Patchsu patch 501 (optional, pick 0500 and/or 0501): gameplay mods from Torii (apply after 0002).

Ported from Torii (the client base of preritsu, Torii-exclusive mods). Names and acronyms are kept as in Torii;
none of them collide with stock osu!lazer mods or with 0500 (Ritsu).

  Fun (osu!):                      Hit Sounder (HS)
  Fun (osu!, taiko, catch, mania): Pitch Adjust (PA)

Mod select shows a "from Torii" plaque on these mods.
Pitch Adjust uses a music-note mod icon sized like the stock icons (embedded in osu.Game), since Torii's own icon
texture is not part of osu! resources.
Torii's automatic Pitch Adjust / pitch-changing DT-HT deselection is not ported.

Replay mod toggles (formerly the separate patch 0007c, old numbering; built only when 0005 is applied too, which defines PATCHSU_REPLAY_MOD_TOGGLES
in Directory.Build.props). These mods join the "Mod effects" group and the clickable mod icons in a replay:
  Hit Sounder   key presses stop making sounds and the notes get the map's own hitsounds back
  Pitch Adjust  the song plays at its normal pitch
As with 0005, only what you hear changes: replay frames, judgements and score stay the same.

